Arrive at Concord same day by 11 pm;

Leave Concord every Tuesday and Saturday at 11 am;

Arrive at Snow Hill same day by 10 am.
1881 From Cambridge, by Hocksburg, Big Mills, Vienna,
Barren Creek Springs, and Salisbury, to Snow
Hill, 81 miles and back, twice a week.
Leave Cambridge every Saturday and Wednesday at
6 am;
Arrive at Snow Hill same day by 5 pm;
Leave Snow Hill every Tuesday and Friday at
6 am;
Arrive at Cambridge same day by 5 pm.
$3.50 From Cambridge by Church Creek, Tobacco Stick,
and Golden Hill, to Lakesville, 22 miles and back,
once a week.
Leave Cambridge every Wednesday at 6 am;
Arrive at Lakesville same day by 1 am;
Leave Lakesville every Wednesday at 1 pm;
Arrive at Cambridge same day by 8 pm.
1888 From Barren Creek Springs by Quanco and White
Haven to Princess Ann, 10 miles and back, once a
week.
Leave Barren Creek Springs every Wednesday at 11 am;
Arrive at Princess Ann same day by 7 pm;
Leave Princess Ann every Thursday at 10 am;
Arrive at Barren Creek Springs same day by 4 pm.
1884 From Princess Ann, by Kingston, Bell Mount,
15 miles and back, three times a week.
Leave Princess Ann every Monday, Wednesday,
and Friday at 8 am;
Arrive at Bell Mount same day by 10 am;
Leave Bell Mount every Monday, Wednesday, and
Friday at 1 pm;
Arrive at Princess Ann same day by 3 pm.
1885 From Barren Creek Springs, by Sharpsown, Laurel, 16 miles and back once a week.
Leave Barren Creek Springs every Thursday at 11 am;
Arrive at Laurel same day by 5 pm;
Leave Laurel every Thursday at 6 am;
